'''Captain Hecklebury Smotts''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located in [[Booty Bay]] in the [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. His crew, boat, and entire fortune were lost when he was attacked by three [[sea giant]]s: [[Gorlash]], [[Negolash]] and [[Mok'rash]]. Gorlash stole his [[Smotts' Chest|Captain's Chest]]. Negolash stole [[Smotts' Cutlass]]. Mok'rash stole his [[Monogrammed Sash]]. Smotts bought another ship, ''[[Smotts' Revenge]]'', to find the sea giants and get his revenge, but they sank that too and killed his second crew. The only other survivor of his second ship was [[Sprogger]], the cook. Smotts is looking for adventurers in order to help recover his possessions that were lost in the attack.

